dsh-message-reminder README · Install：The package declares its own bundle patch (`dsh.bundle.patch`), so it inserts its row into the profile when the profile loads. `dsh plugin add` is a `pnpm add` inside the profile, so make sure the package name also appears in that profile's bundle list:

```jsonc
// $DSH_HOME/profiles/<your-profile>/package.json
{
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": ["...", "dsh-message-reminder"] } }
}
